{"version":1,"key":"card:142","content":{"id":142,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0a317138-cd31-4bb7-8209-622ea962ac16","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一个值可能同时具有多种可能的类型，在断言为具体的类型之前只能使用公共的属性和方法"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"54136a83-412a-4cc6-837c-d75d0a9b0354","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"2daa748d-2200-4aac-a292-dd12f2f3e5bd","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const strOrNum: string | number = \"a\";\n// ❎\nstrOrNum.toLowerCase();\n// ✅\n(strOrNum as string).toLowerCase();","collabId":"4cc9763b-12c8-40c3-aee4-e0d00bca47fb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ecf8eb53-e656-4c0b-9bbf-47fa9b6f389d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"as"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 断言为主动断言，还可以通过一些方法判断类型，ts 可以帮助将类型进行收缩"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"6a4df4b4-cea2-48c0-a8ce-c80a5037e0cd","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"baf7ccb4-7804-4d5f-b3cb-fc8b5a96992c","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const strOrNum: string | number = \"a\";\nif (typeof strOrNum === 'string') {\n  // 经过 typeof 判断后，类型收缩到 string 类型\n  // 不用手动断言即可直接使用 string 下的方法\n  strOrNum.toLowerCase();\n} else {\n  // 此处会将 string 这种可能性去掉，因此只能是 number\n  // 可以使用 number 独有的方法\n  strOrNum.toFixed(2);\n}","collabId":"0c7557c8-e27a-4cb9-ba04-7b4f65f34822","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a72c7543-6812-4c88-9e55-7ebc89d08a44","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"根据分支的判断条件，ts 会尝试推导类型，将值可能的类型进行尽可能的收窄，这种类型推断的行为称之为"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"类型守卫"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"typeof"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是一种常见的类型守卫，除此之外，还有其它的类型守卫，如："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"6b9de613-83cb-4a8b-9f18-0c2e199041fd","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"cd4c7670-546c-4736-9f3e-7c168a8e1d01","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0a6510a8-329c-41e3-a63c-323d250d398d","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"==="}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"e0c47a10-c01b-467e-b9e8-44c1ae888e4e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1f319eb6-5e6d-4c24-9205-a834a76489e2","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"in"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"2f3293d6-73f5-43b3-9268-f91c7b6138bf","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d8c8b5da-a2b4-4307-84e4-2900b80514ad","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"instanceof"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"70a47745-28d3-4661-90d2-29462827ccaa","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c08c0e8c-5b0e-475c-9fd6-b58608564f21","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"类型守卫函数"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"28762881-4f31-48b2-bff2-8535c0178340","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"99fbecf7-e5d9-4f76-87da-0d6d1693acef","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"断言函数"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c3212c2e-4d78-4f10-8ea1-f8c95a0627e2","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"==="},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"!=="},{"type":"formatted","text":" 一般用于字面量类型的判断"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"89f2be9d-693f-45ed-973f-d2857df9190d","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"23110a19-87b3-47b1-87c7-2d509a170cff","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const oneOr1: \"one\" | 1 = 1;\n\nif (oneOr1 === 1) {\n  // 是数字 1\n} else {\n  // 是英文 one\n}","collabId":"d972d16b-e404-4d3d-a04c-4d21f17b1840","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9dd1a23b-ca35-461a-af10-b92e74d80946","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"也可用于对象属性的字面量判断，从而区分类型"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"436726ab-0449-40d5-b908-e68ea633f4de","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"e852435f-3bb0-40b7-b3ae-a5e2b17269d2","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"enum EType {\n\tDOG = 1,\n  CAT = 2\n}\n\ninterface Dog {\n  type: EType.DOG;\n  name: string;\n}\n\ninterface Cat {\n  type: EType.CAT;\n  name: string;\n}\n\nconst dogOrCat = {\n  type: EType.DOG,\n  name: '旺财'\n}\n\nif (dogOrCat.type === EType.DOG) {\n  // 是 Dog 类型\n} else {\n  // 是 Cat 类型\n}","collabId":"fdfc8dd4-50cb-419a-bd43-1cf976e27dd0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"note","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"c59d8f7f-33c1-4282-bb84-0d34b3e718ff","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"de4d3422-c512-4f6c-908e-3d04eaef9ef6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"==="},{"type":"formatted","text":" 判断对象的属性来收缩对象类型时，要确保该属性是"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"highlight":true,"text":"字面量类型"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，比如我将 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Dog"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Cat"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的类型都声明为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"EType"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就无法进行类型推断"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"5e121f6f-37ae-456b-aaae-4d02db5fcd46","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"53f5b7ba-a762-4d2e-9d8a-079244a3299e","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"interface Dog {\n  type: EType;\n  name: string;\n}\n\ninterface Cat {\n  type: EType;\n  name: string;\n}","collabId":"1541f96d-0610-477f-98fa-657f92f62db7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"20001177-f768-4b29-8675-cfefd5a445ae","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这种情况下可以使用"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"自定义类型守卫"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，见下。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c6e13bce-7e3c-4982-98df-eaec33d4892e","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"in"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 操作符可以判断某个属性是否存在于对象中，如果某个对象具有独一无二的属性，通过此判断可以将类型收缩到此对象类型"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"39dec1a9-1e17-42d3-9824-05f1f9680323","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"f081afca-c4d5-43a4-a585-20b59cc0e1db","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"interface Foo {\n  fooOnly: boolean;\n  shared: number;\n}\n\ninterface Bar {\n  barOnly: boolean;\n  shared: number;\n}\n\ndeclare const i: Foo | Bar;\nif ('barOnly' in i) {\n  // 收缩为 Bar 类型\n} else {\n  // 收缩为 Foo 类型\n}","collabId":"4f356705-d39c-4e7d-bf6f-2e23e1cf3e67","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9b164832-fa13-4ff9-8102-69c0cd46c322","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"instanceof"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是用来判断值是否是某个类的示例"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"0f33cc47-027c-4b8b-aa41-ca8901abc921","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"9bcb91fe-2072-4d54-af7b-aa3a8e527811","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"class Foo {\n\tfoo();\n}\n\nclass Bar {\n\tbar();\n}\n\ndeclare const input: Foo | Bar;\n\nif (input instanceof Foo) {\n  // 收缩为 Foo 的实例，可以调用 foo 方法\n  input.foo();\n} else {\n  // 收缩为 Bar 的实例\n  input.bar();\n}","collabId":"428ba319-aa81-4c99-bed4-379b202f02f1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"116f95ed-bf6c-4132-8724-579621a6c3eb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"考虑如下两个类型"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"31473eae-abbb-4b45-8c79-2ef7f52824ee","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"01967810-4d4a-400b-b347-df1d12511913","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"interface Foo {\n  type: string;\n}\n\ninterface Bar {\n  type: number;\n}","collabId":"44ab986e-a4f1-4b06-8bb4-b08246098d3d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4a3a05c8-8d3a-417b-b00f-2a78a6a19f73","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Foo"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Bar"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 都包含有 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"type"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类型，并且是不同的类型，但是我们却不能通过判断 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"type"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的类型使得类型进行收缩"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"0648995d-8794-45ed-9964-651af4529eb5","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"c1d55127-9e2f-4634-aa92-4380234e0f77","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"declare const a: Foo | Bar;\nif (typeof a.type === 'string') {\n  // 不能将 a 收缩到 Foo 类型\n}","collabId":"b8972375-fb05-4e23-83c0-100a6a2e5ae3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"441bfa27-cde7-44c3-bcfa-a3294b0d0286","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这个时候可以使用自定义的类型守卫"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"71ea6a45-175e-4126-9ec7-0c9163da0506","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"c7ff3ca8-e7fe-4043-afba-19f68953a94c","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"function isFoo(val: Foo | Bar) val is Foo  {\n  return typeof val.type === 'string';\n}\n\nif (isFoo(a)) {\n  // 可以收缩到 Foo 类型\n}","collabId":"05e5d3fb-48d5-4270-8449-e290bbaecdf5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"acfaae07-3f91-492a-9778-0fd25e17f471","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"标准库的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Array.isArray"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法就是通过这种方式将类型收缩到数组的："}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022/raw/master/image.73el2m1zoh40.png","previewUrl":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022/raw/master/image.73el2m1zoh40.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"bf02d40f-9d57-4e2b-b617-8d176a1675da","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"520cd91d-49a8-4181-a2fd-eb56ba0dd0c7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"还有一种方法可以收缩类型，那就是断言，断言一般常见于测试中，一旦断言失败，就表示未达到预期，抛出异常，退出程序。因此能运行到断言后面的代码，就表示断言通过了，可以通过这一特性来收缩类型"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"96f5675a-eba4-4c90-a524-8fb0939c1ba1","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"3bff1856-0041-4947-b341-645406937bcf","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"function assertIsNumber(val: any): assert val is number {\n  if (!typeof val !== 'number') {\n    throw new Error();\n  }\n}\n\nconst val: number | string = 12;\nassertIsNumber(val);\n\n// 运行到这里，说明上面的断言通过了，此时 val 的类型一定是 number\nval * 100;","collabId":"4dadc161-a80f-425c-acbc-983fa18ab852","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["TypeScript/类型守卫"],"createTime":1689642908765,"updateTime":1752923855408,"linkedCards":[{"id":15,"target":{"key":"card:15","type":"card","id":15},"summary":"TypeScript 内置了三个类型： any 、 unknown 和 never 。 any 表示任意类型，一个变量如果标注为 any 类型，那么它可以接受任何类型的赋值，也可以赋值为任何的类型 let s: any = \"Hello W...","tags":["TypeScript/数据类型"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1752923855408}}